{"ID":"20240220132638-4siaed6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132638-4siaed6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132638-4siaed6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161145-ob0xz0d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161145-pr73yr6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:644,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161145-iyhjrus\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:314,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:314\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝甘草汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312161145-ob0xz0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-ob0xz0d","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第六十九条。第七十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-59ierwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-59ierwa","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：发汗过多,其人叉手自冒心,心下悸欲得按者,「桂枝甘草汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-pwfcljy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-pwfcljy","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：发汗后,其人脐下悸者,欲作「奔豚」,「茯苓桂枝甘草大枣汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-xckrs7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-xckrs7l","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240228093016-wye5msk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-wzzay73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-wzzay73","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面会出现很多的像脐下悸、心下悸这种现象。心下动悸，心下在两肋骨相交下面（约鸠尾穴处），你摸下去可以摸到跳动。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚脐左边肝，脐中间是脾，脐右边是肺，脐上方有动悸是从肾脏下手治疗，脐左边有动悸从肝脏下手治疗，脐下方有动悸是从心脏下手治疗，肚脐右边有动悸从肺脏开始下手。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那诸位要有这样一个基本的概念，慢慢我们进入金匮的时候，会介绍一个很厉害的处方，也是我救过很多的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-xnjsa2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-xnjsa2r","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里先学脐下动悸，肚脐以下动悸是心脏，所以肚脐往下走有关元穴，关元小肠的募穴，和心脏是表里。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-iyhjrus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-iyhjrus","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个你发汗过多，当我们处方使用麻黄汤的时候，肺里面的津液会往外走，跑到皮肤毛孔上流汗出来，正常身体很好的人，当津液出去的时候，人体是没有间隙的，不能有空气的，所以汗一出去，后面会自然补位。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"正常人，食物到胃，进入小肠，小肠是火很热，把食物分解掉，分解掉进入大肠只剩下水和食物的残渣，水在上面，小肠火在下面烧，水回头到肺里面，这是肺最好的津液。你如果没有经过这个管道，喝水，喝下去就跑掉了，根本不会经过小肠，大肠。所以有的人渴饮千杯不能止渴，所以肺里面的水一定要从食物里面的水来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们取得水有两个管道，一个是食物里面的水，食物里面的水会为我们身体所受用，这是我们阴的来源，血的源头，当你的肺里面的水排掉以后，下面的水没办法上来，顶在这个地方，就会出现叉手自冒心，心下悸欲得按，为什么要按在这边，他按着比较舒服，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喜按"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。诸位要记得，只要喜按，代表里面没有问题，按着不舒服，代表里面有实症，就危险，肿块、肿瘤，大便堵到也是不要按。这里按到，是虚症，没有东西，只是水冲上来，这个时候是桂枝甘草汤主之。平常人，你发汗就好了，有的人就会有心下悸，他平常肠胃不好，所以汽化的功能不够，你药下去的时候，汗发掉了，水补位没那么快，不像肠胃好人，补位很快。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-2ylq4ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-2ylq4ma","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常我们身上"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水和水气不相等，水气是我们身上所受用的，水我们身上不受用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，意思是这个水的冷的，寒的，水气是热的。水冲上来的时候，才会有这种动悸的现象，因为心脏是火，比如你汽车引擎很热，结果你水倒到引擎上面，引擎正在热，你水倒上去，所以会有动悸的现象，心不受这个水，这个时候我们用桂枝甘草汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么用桂枝，就是加强心脏喷射的力量，因为桂枝在本草里面，能降冲逆，就是指这个地方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们有桂枝加桂汤，桂枝汤里加肉桂。像桂枝甘草汤，这个冲是冲脉往上升，有桂枝上来可以把这个水气化掉，因为只是中焦，心下这个地方，所以我们用桂枝就好了，这是弥补的措施。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-3q4889e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-3q4889e","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝甘草汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-b70x4cd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-b70x4cd","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝四两去皮，甘草二两炙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-2tn32pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-2tn32pf","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味,以水三升,煮取一升,去滓,顿服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-d5jmb29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-d5jmb29","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剂量上四比二，桂枝四，炙甘草二。一剂喝下去就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-9vv4r91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-9vv4r91","updated":"20240312161145"}},{"ID":"20240312161145-4dqgjat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-4dqgjat","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第七十条是你发汗以后在脐下悸，脐下动悸，苓桂甘草汤(茯苓桂枝甘草大枣汤)."}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-30nc65u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-30nc65u","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六十九和七十条的差异就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"六十九条，是吃麻黄汤太过以后产生的现象，七十条，吃桂枝汤太过以后产生的现象，所以动悸的位置不一样。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六十九吃麻黄汤，发汗太过，肺里面的津液不够，下面的津液来补的时候，来不及补，耿在这（心下），所以产生心下悸。这个是桂枝甘草汤，两味药就够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-sudlz16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-sudlz16","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第七十条是，你如果说吃桂枝汤太多，你怎么知道他吃过头了，就是病人有脐下动悸的现象，欲作奔豚，就是准备要奔豚还没有发奔豚，那我们后面会特别介绍奔豚的症状。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"同样是桂枝甘草，但是我们同样加了茯苓红枣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茯苓可以去烦，利尿，茯苓是白色，在松树的根下面，山猪啃过的地方就有茯苓，茯苓本身有滋润津液的功能，茯神能够定心神，茯神、茯苓都是在松树下面，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓本来就有除烦的功能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-nfqnc8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-nfqnc8u","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝甘草茯苓大枣汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-aql5cjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-aql5cjn","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓半斤，甘草二两炙，大枣十五枚劈，桂枝三两去皮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161145-pr73yr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161145-pr73yr6","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味,以甘澜水一斗,先煮茯苓,减二升,纳诸药,煮取三升,去滓,温服一升,日三服。作甘澜水法,取水二斗,置大盆内以杓扬之,水上有珠子五六千颗相逐,取用之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}